-- title:
--   A refined bound for the saddle-point factor
-- statement:
--   Let $a>0$ be real and $w\in\mathbb C$ satisfy $|w|\le a/2$. Let
--
--   $$\Phi_a(w)=e^{2\pi iaw-\pi iw^2}
--   \left(1+\frac wa\right)^{-1/2-2\pi ia^2},\quad
--   E_1=-\frac{2\pi iw^3}{3a}-\frac{w}{2a},\quad
--   R=\frac{\pi|w|^4}{a^2}+\frac{|w|^2}{2a^2}.$$
--
--   For the principal complex power,
--
--   $$|\Phi_a(w)-1|\le |E_1|+R+(|E_1|+R)^2e^{|E_1|+R}.$$
--
--   This refined bound separates the leading error from the remainder.
